10
00:00:30,748 --> 00:00:33,532
Salicylic acid clears pore congestion.

11
00:00:34,232 --> 00:00:37,713
Next come oil-absorbing clays, kaolin and bentonite.

12
00:00:37,713 --> 00:00:39,587
They help detoxify the skin.

13
00:00:40,287 --> 00:00:43,196
