17
00:00:53,207 --> 00:00:57,132
There's also licorice and niacinamide, which help even skin tone.

18
00:00:57,832 --> 00:01:01,264
So, put together, you get three things in one masque.

19
00:01:01,264 --> 00:01:06,445
Salicylic acid and clays to clear, oat and bisabolol to calm, and safflower oil,

20
00:01:06,445 --> 00:01:10,460
