22
00:01:12,350 --> 00:01:16,494
Start by cleansing your skin, so the masque goes onto a fresh surface.

23
00:01:17,194 --> 00:01:20,005
Apply a smooth layer over your face and throat.

24
00:01:20,005 --> 00:01:21,141
Avoid the eye area.

25
00:01:21,841 --> 00:01:23,562
Use it three times a week.

26
00:01:23,562 --> 00:01:28,924
If only your T-zone gets oily or congested, you can apply it to the T-zone alone.

27
00:01:29,624 --> 00:01:34,280
